{"id":"0705a404435af43f","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pibound.md","title":"Universal bound on prime implicants","display":"thm-pibound — Universal bound on prime implicants","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pibound","aliases":["27-thm-pibound"],"display":"thm-pibound — Universal bound on prime implicants","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pibound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pibound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pibound — Universal bound on prime implicants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (Boolean functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> (canonical Boolean terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> (prime-implicant set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Term}_n|=3^n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\leq3^n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathrm{Term}_n|=3^n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\leq3^n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each coordinate is absent, positive, or negative in a canonical term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (Boolean functions, see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_n$ (canonical Boolean terms, see [[27-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ (prime-implicant set, see [[27-df-piset]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{Term}_n|=3^n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(|\\mathrm{PI}(f)|\\leq3^n)","display":true}],"bytes":843,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-508","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pibound|thm-pibound — Universal bound on prime implicants]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","e065076d6b51508e","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}